  vendorName: Collector Clarence
  offerText: I simply must have that enormous, hideous rug covering your floor for
    my gallery. Allow me to roll it up and take it away, and I shall leave you with
    a very heavy purse.
  acceptResultText: Clarence's men remove the heavy rug and hand you the money. The
    room feels wonderfully spacious and your wallet is thick.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to part with the rug. Ten minutes later, you trip
    over its frayed edge, falling hard and painfully bruising your knee.
